00:05:42.840 --> 00:05:45.480
Problem two was the
barrier to entry.

00:05:45.480 --> 00:05:49.200
We took the Azure portal
dependency out of the picture.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:52.710
You can sign in with your
Entra ID and start building.

00:05:52.710 --> 00:05:55.680
