expertise is required.

00:05:55.680 --> 00:06:00.420
Yet, whatever you are building
is being built on Azure.

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:03.810
These two things almost
never come together.

00:06:03.810 --> 00:06:08.850
They do now, and that's what
led to this next announcement.

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:12.600
Today, we are introducing
Azure Logic Apps Automation,

00:06:12.600 --> 00:06:15.270
enterprise-ready
automation platform built

00:06:15.270 --> 00:06:17.820
for developers of every kind.

00:06:17.820 --> 00:06:21.990
It offers low barrier to entry
with the same enterprise rigor.

00:06:21.990 --> 00:06:26.760
It's available in public preview
today at auto.azure.com.

00:06:26.760 --> 00:06:29.190
Four things that
define this offering.

00:06:29.190 --> 00:06:32.790
It's the same enterprise-ready
platform that runs trillions

00:06:32.790 --> 00:06:35.340
of action executions per month,

00:06:35.340 --> 00:06:39.030
which means that it's
production-ready from day one.

00:06:39.030 --> 00:06:43.050
All your day zero friction goes
away because all the compute,

00:06:43.050 --> 00:06:44.970
infrastructure, and provisioning

00:06:44.970 --> 00:06:48.360
of services is hosted
on your behalf.

00:06:48.360 --> 00:06:51.690
You sign in, and you're ready
to build the workflows.

00:06:51.690 --> 00:06:55.170
Thirdly, you don't need
Azure portal to get started.

00:06:55.170 --> 00:06:56.820
It's hosted outside Azure,

00:06:56.820 --> 00:07:01.680
and all you need is Microsoft
Entra ID to log in.

00:07:01.680 --> 00:07:04.800
And fourthly, this is still
built for enterprises.

00:07:04.800 --> 00:07:06.270
All the production-ready

00:07:06.270 --> 00:07:09.030
and enterprise controls
are still built in.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:13.950
You get isolated compute, RBAC,
auditability, VNet support,

00:07:13.950 --> 00:07:16.110
and everything else
that Logic Apps

00:07:16.110 --> 00:07:19.200
as an enterprise platform
offers you today.

00:07:19.200 --> 00:07:21.330
The goal was simple here.

00:07:21.330 --> 00:07:25.740
We wanted to remove the
friction, but not the rigor.

00:07:25.740 --> 00:07:29.160
So let's see this in
action through a demo.

00:07:29.160 --> 00:07:30.390
SPEAKER 1: In this demo,

00:07:30.390 --> 00:07:33.390
let's automate using
Logic Apps Automation.

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:36.060
Remember those prerequisites
