00:18:58.530 --> 00:19:02.010
to bring together both
deterministic steps as well

00:19:02.010 --> 00:19:05.850
as agent reasoning in
a single workflow.

00:19:05.850 --> 00:19:07.230
SPEAKER 1: Here in Logic Apps,

00:19:07.230 --> 00:19:11.400
we start by creating a workflow
and adding an agent node.

00:19:11.400 --> 00:19:14.700
The agent connects to a Foundry
project, and from here,

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:18.470
we can pick any model or
existing agent in that project.

00:19:18.470 --> 00:19:19.670
See the drop-down.

00:19:19.670 --> 00:19:23.330
Every agent in Foundry
shows up, ready to invoke.

00:19:23.330 --> 00:19:26.630
And if the one we need doesn't
