00:19:26.630 --> 00:19:28.530
without leaving Logic Apps.

00:19:28.530 --> 00:19:30.840
The deep link to
Foundry lets us jump

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:32.790
between portals when we need to.

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:35.130
Let's create a new
agent right here.

00:19:35.130 --> 00:19:37.770
All we need is a
