00:19:37.770 --> 00:19:41.250
Behind the scenes, Logic
Apps calls the Foundry APIs

00:19:41.250 --> 00:19:42.940
to provision it.

00:19:48.300 --> 00:19:50.700
And there it is in
our Foundry project.

00:19:50.700 --> 00:19:52.650
Let's update the instructions.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:55.800
Any change we make here flows
