00:19:55.800 --> 00:19:58.240
The agent stays in sync.

00:20:06.720 --> 00:20:10.590
Now, a real-world scenario, an
auto loan approval workflow

00:20:10.590 --> 00:20:13.800
that handles incoming loan
requests autonomously.

00:20:13.800 --> 00:20:17.490
It runs in real time using
a triage agent in Foundry

00:20:17.490 --> 00:20:20.100
for duplicate checks,
then an auto loan agent

00:20:20.100 --> 00:20:21.540
