00:20:37.650 --> 00:20:42.000
These are native Logic Apps
connectors, APIs, and workflows.

00:20:42.000 --> 00:20:43.200
That's the unlock.

00:20:43.200 --> 00:20:47.070
Foundry as your AI platform and
the full Logic Apps ecosystem

00:20:47.070 --> 00:20:51.210
with 1,400 plus connectors,
your APIs, your custom code,

00:20:51.210 --> 00:20:55.810
as your agent's tools, all on
a proven enterprise platform.

00:20:56.850 --> 00:20:59.700
Let's kick it off by
submitting a loan request.

00:20:59.700 --> 00:21:02.370
This particular request will
need human approval before it

00:21:02.370 --> 00:21:04.060
can complete.

00:21:07.170 --> 00:21:10.800
In Logic Apps run history,
we can see every step

00:21:10.800 --> 00:21:13.020
of the workflow
with full detail.

00:21:13.020 --> 00:21:16.530
Right now, the agent is paused,
