00:21:16.530 --> 00:21:19.380
With Logic Apps workflows,
you can build long-running,

00:21:19.380 --> 00:21:22.650
human-in-the-loop processes
with your Foundry agents.

00:21:22.650 --> 00:21:25.350
The approval request
lands in Teams.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:28.740
Once the approval responds,
the workflow resumes,

00:21:28.740 --> 00:21:31.260
