00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:08.070
debug agent behavior, and
track quality over time.

00:22:08.070 --> 00:22:12.030
Same execution, two lenses,
correlated by run ID

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:14.430
across both portals, so
you get the right view

00:22:14.430 --> 00:22:18.010
in the right place without
losing the thread between them.

